  "description": "Do you think you can conquer the entire martial arts world with just one bowl of Jajangmyeon? The protagonist dreamed of becoming the best Chinese chef, but was sent to the Song Dynasty in China! However, when he woke up, there was no martial arts at all, and all that was left was the cooking skills he had learned in his previous life. But these dishes... the response is very good! In this life , will he be able to captivate Jungwon with Jjajangmyeon and live a successful second life?\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
